NOTE ON SCOPE

This MIT licence covers only the author's own work: the static analyser, the
execution harness, the retrieval script, the analysis and generation scripts, the
build configuration, and the tests.

It does NOT cover:

  * the LLM-generated Java corpora under */src/main/java/**/services/<model>/ —
    see CORPUS_TERMS.md;
  * Project Euler material — see NOTICE.

